</LI>
<LI>Count-min sketch to approximate frequencies from an input stream.
<BR/><B>Topics to be covered:</B>  Explain hash functions as blackboxes mentioning just the statistical properties you will
 use. Explain the problem scenario. Explain the technique with an example. Show how Markov inequality is used. No need to
 code anything.
<BR/>
<B>Resource:</B>  <LINK to="https://sites.google.com/site/countminsketch/home/expositions">This page</LINK>  contains
 expository articles on the topic.
<UL><LI><RED><TICK/></RED>Shinjan M, Anmol, Ankesh, Danish, Pardha Sarathi</LI>
<LI><RED><TICK/></RED>Aarav, Diksha, Disha, Divyansh, Sejal</LI>
