<LI>BJKST algorithm for counting distinct elements from an input stream.
<BR/><B>Topics to be covered:</B>  Explain hash functions as blackboxes mentioning just the statistical properties you will
 use. Explain the problem scenario. Explain the technique with an example. Show how Markov inequality is used. No need to
 code anything.
<BR/>
<B>Resource:</B>  <LINK to="https://github.com/Yaishnavi/BJKST_Count_distinct_words">This github page</LINK> 
 contains some python code using this algo for counting words in a file. 
Here is a <LINK to="https://sites.ualberta.ca/~mrs/courses/Streaming19/lecture3.pdf">more mathematical exposition</LINK>.
