<BR/><B>Topics to be covered:</B>  Define 3D random walk. Clearly define the result to be proved. Prove it. Contrast with
 lower dimensional cases (which need not be proved).
<BR/>
<B>Resource:</B>  <LINK to="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=byvEzyFgv44">This video</LINK> 
will give a flavour of random walk. But don't get carried away by all the information provided there. Keep your focus on
 a rigourous proof. 
